Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 21:38:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Play the purple, cyan and yellow heals for effects 0x459,
 0x477 and 0x478

HEAL_TYPE_PURPLE, HEAL_TYPE_CYAN and HEAL_TYPE_YELLOW were 0x59e, 0x5bc
and 0x5bd, each 0x145 too high. The heal factory is registered for
0x459, 0x477 and 0x478 (effect_registry.c), so those effects reached
heal_effect_step_spawns, matched no case and drew nothing.

The original's heal step (0x9aabf0) compares the type above 0x145
against exactly 0x459, 0x477 (0x459 + 0x1e) and 0x478 (+1). The 0x459
case spawns ring_white columns coloured (115, 25, 115), the 0x477 case
alpha_down columns and sparkles coloured (0, 255, 255), and the 0x478
case the same coloured (255, 255, 0): styles 6, 7 and 8 here. All three
IDs are registered with the heal constructor 0x9618c0; 0x59e, 0x5bc and
0x5bd are registered with another constructor, 0x9612c0.

The new test_heal_colours runs heal_effect.c whole for 100 frames with
the particle functions recorded: 0x459, 0x477 and 0x478 must each spawn
42 column particles with their texture and colour and 36 sparkles with
their colour, and 0x138 the green heal. It fails on the previous
constants ("Heal type 0x459 drew nothing").

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VaQB81YtRGLtH8zvfX7WTY
